svg-editor 0.1 — type 'help' for commands
svg> init 800 600
canvas 800x600 created
svg> create box n1 120 100 160 60 "开始"
box#n1 created
svg> create box n2 520 100 160 60 "处理数据"
box#n2 created
svg> create line arrow1 280 130 520 130 black
line#arrow1 created
svg> group flowchart n1 n2 arrow1
g#flowchart created with 3 children
svg> move n2 0 100
box#n2 moved by (0,100)
svg> undo
box#n2 moved back by (0,-100)
svg> set n2 fill #f5a623
box#n2 updated: fill=#f5a623
svg> set n2 label "处理数据 v2"
box#n2 updated: label="处理数据 v2"
svg> undo
box#n2 updated: label="处理数据"
svg> tree
svg (800x600) *
└── g#flowchart *
    ├── g#n1 * (box)
    │   ├── rect#n1-rect  x=120 y=100 width=160 height=60 *
    │   └── text#n1-label  x=140 y=135 text="开始" *
    ├── g#n2 * (box)
    │   ├── rect#n2-rect  x=520 y=100 width=160 height=60 *
    │   └── text#n2-label  x=540 y=135 text="处理数据" *
    └── line#arrow1  x1=280 y1=130 x2=520 y2=130 *
